1
00:00:40,399 --> 00:00:41,399
This is you.

2
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,800
And the other woman,

3
00:00:44,480 --> 00:00:47,280
the one who later adopted Yong
Qi is Professor Liang Huan, isn't it?

4
00:01:05,720 --> 00:01:07,640
This is Professor Liang Huan.

5
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:09,360
Until I was eight

6
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:11,000
she was the one who took me in.

7
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:24,439
At a private hospital in England

8
00:01:24,440 --> 00:01:25,800
I found several medical records.

9
00:01:28,200 --> 00:01:29,200
Auntie Xu.

10
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:33,320
You had a hysterectomy for uterine cancer.

11
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,320
And the date is before Xu Feiyu was born.

12
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:45,520
Song Yi.

13
00:01:46,280 --> 00:01:47,720
What are you talking about?

14
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:02,000
Liang Huan had surgery
at that same hospital.

15
00:02:02,600 --> 00:02:03,600
An embryo transfer.

16
00:02:04,320 --> 00:02:05,560
Nine months later

17
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,800
she had a C-section.

18
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:24,400
The child in this photo

19
00:02:30,120 --> 00:02:31,480
is that Xu Feiyu?

20
00:02:48,920 --> 00:02:49,920
Yes.

21
00:02:52,120 --> 00:02:53,120
It's Xu Feiyu.

22
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:12,320
Back then.

23
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:15,720
Liang Huan and I

24
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:19,279
desperately wanted

25
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,920
a child of our own.

26
00:03:22,880 --> 00:03:25,280
It was a decision we made together.

27
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:10,280
Then.

28
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,840
Song Yang found out about us

29
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:19,560
and he told Liang Huan's parents.

30
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:24,000
It caused a huge scandal.

31
00:04:25,880 --> 00:04:26,880
After that

32
00:04:28,240 --> 00:04:30,640
they dragged Liang Huan back to Poland.

33
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:36,720
They

34
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:40,400
cut off every way we
had of reaching each other.

35
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:45,520
They even lied to Liang Huan,

36
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:49,280
telling her the baby died soon after birth.

37
00:04:56,320 --> 00:04:57,760
Later on...

38
00:04:59,120 --> 00:05:00,440
Song Yang

39
00:05:01,520 --> 00:05:03,120
brought the child back.

40
00:05:12,040 --> 00:05:13,960
He never let me see the boy...

41
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,360
not until I gave in to him.

42
00:05:27,200 --> 00:05:28,400
I still remember

43
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:31,240
my mother loved me so much.

44
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:37,720
But she was always somewhere
else alone, looking up at the sky.

45
00:05:42,960 --> 00:05:43,960
And then

46
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:46,720
slowly, she just withered away.

47
00:05:48,320 --> 00:05:49,520
It was Song Yang!

48
00:05:50,080 --> 00:05:51,720
Song Yang and the rest of them!

49
00:05:52,720 --> 00:05:56,120
They conspired together to kill her!

50
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:59,120
Are you satisfied now?

51
00:06:18,200 --> 00:06:19,200
Song Yi.

52
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,200
Now that you know everything

53
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,760
from now on

54
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:30,320
you are never to speak of this again.

55
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,160
Xu Feiyu

56
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,960
is Liang Huan's son

57
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:38,400
and he is my son too.

58
00:06:55,320 --> 00:06:57,240
I never gave you permission to come back.

59
00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:59,320
And from now on.

60
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:02,200
I will certainly never allow

61
00:07:03,080 --> 00:07:05,520
what you feel for Xu Feiyu.

62
00:07:16,880 --> 00:07:22,120
Feiyu! Wow, so handsome!

63
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,560
Hey, hey, hey.

64
00:07:40,561 --> 00:07:42,480
Feiyu, I have a question for you.

65
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,079
After Song Yi got his sight back

66
00:07:44,080 --> 00:07:45,839
did he really never see your face?

67
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:46,920
I have a question too.

68
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,479
In the rest of the story

69
00:07:48,480 --> 00:07:50,359
will Feiyu go back to Song Yi?

70
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,399
If Feiyu doesn't love Song Yi

71
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:52,640
why did he leave?

72
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:55,920
Could you tell us how the comic ends?

73
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:57,280
Let me explain.

74
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:59,279
The Xu Feiyu and Song Yi you see

75
00:07:59,280 --> 00:08:00,519
are characters I made up.

76
00:08:00,520 --> 00:08:01,400
And what you see

77
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:03,160
is just a story I made up.

78
00:08:03,720 --> 00:08:06,079
I just didn't put my heart into drawing it

79
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:07,080
so even now

80
00:08:07,081 --> 00:08:08,600
I still don't know how it ends.

81
00:08:09,920 --> 00:08:11,400
Um, I have one more question.

82
00:08:12,400 --> 00:08:12,880
Go ahead.

83
00:08:12,881 --> 00:08:14,759
Why is it that on the cover.

84
00:08:14,760 --> 00:08:16,120
Feiyu's face is blurred

85
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,479
but inside the book

86
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,720
it's your own face?

87
00:08:19,586 --> 00:08:20,586
Well...

88
00:08:20,760 --> 00:08:22,120
When I first created them

89
00:08:22,200 --> 00:08:23,560
I was going by their psychology.

90
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:25,400
Since Song Yi couldn't see

91
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:28,720
so in his eyes, Feiyu's
face had to be a blur.

92
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:30,720
It's just that

93
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:31,760
later I felt

94
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:33,240
they could never be apart.

95
00:08:33,720 --> 00:08:35,120
And to the two of them,

96
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:37,160
they're the other half of each other.

97
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:40,040
So I used my own image for all of them.

98
00:08:40,760 --> 00:08:42,280
It's as if in that world

99
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:43,360
they

100
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:44,600
are each other...

101
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,120
they

102
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:46,960
are one.

103
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,640
Wow… that's fascinating…

104
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:50,919
I sort of followed that

105
00:08:50,920 --> 00:08:51,920
and sort of didn't

106
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:53,279
I don't really get it.

107
00:08:53,280 --> 00:08:54,680
Feiyu, sign this for me～

108
00:09:31,296 --> 00:09:33,756
[TN: If you look at the bottom right, you'll
see the thin veneer of AI breaking mid-shot]

109
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:30,120
Ah

110
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:30,720
you're here

111
00:11:30,880 --> 00:11:31,520
great writer!

112
00:11:31,600 --> 00:11:32,720
How many times now

113
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:34,079
I'm a comic artist.

114
00:11:34,080 --> 00:11:34,640
All right.

115
00:11:34,720 --> 00:11:36,016
Comic artist, what'll it be tonight?

116
00:11:36,040 --> 00:11:36,480
The usual!

117
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:38,000
Knew you'd say that.

118
00:11:38,200 --> 00:11:38,480
Here.

119
00:11:38,560 --> 00:11:39,800
It's all ready for you.

120
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,320
Thanks.

121
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:04,080
Cheers!

122
00:13:01,000 --> 00:13:02,000
How is it?

123
00:15:28,480 --> 00:15:29,480
Xu Feiyu.

124
00:15:33,640 --> 00:15:37,880
Xu Feiyu… Xu Feiyu… Xu Feiyu.

125
00:15:37,960 --> 00:15:38,960
Ugh!

126
00:15:53,720 --> 00:15:54,840
Xu Feiyu.

127
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:01,520
Xu Feiyu.

128
00:16:01,680 --> 00:16:02,680
Xu Feiyu!

129
00:16:05,480 --> 00:16:06,480
Xu Feiyu!

130
00:16:07,000 --> 00:16:08,000
Xu Feiyu!

131
00:16:09,600 --> 00:16:10,680
Xu Feiyu!

132
00:16:12,400 --> 00:16:13,400
Xu Feiyu.

133
00:16:14,400 --> 00:16:15,680
Where did you go, Xu Feiyu!

134
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:18,560
Xu Feiyu!
